WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:02.039
(whoosh, creak)

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:07.281
- An existential haunting?

00:00:07.281 --> 00:00:09.788
That's very weird, I would not think of

00:00:09.788 --> 00:00:12.447
a haunted experience and existential

00:00:12.447 --> 00:00:14.269
in the same breath.

00:00:14.269 --> 00:00:16.161
Does that mean it's gonna,

00:00:16.161 --> 00:00:17.206
change me?

00:00:17.206 --> 00:00:19.087
- I mean, I read a couple things online

00:00:19.087 --> 00:00:21.583
from people who've wrote articles

00:00:21.583 --> 00:00:24.090
about their experience,
but it never really

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.401
went into detail, so
I'm kind of in the dark

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:27.643
on this one.

00:00:27.643 --> 00:00:29.442
- Yeah, maybe literally in the dark

00:00:29.442 --> 00:00:31.567
later tonight, we'll see.

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:34.643
- Having done this before,
I find it is scary,

00:00:34.643 --> 00:00:38.625
but the more I do it,
the more excited I am,

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:41.585
the more I realize this
is more about wonderment.

00:00:41.585 --> 00:00:44.406
- It's all about getting inside your head

00:00:44.406 --> 00:00:46.600
and freaking you out on this deeper level,

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.143
which is what I'm really excited about.

00:00:49.143 --> 00:00:50.083
- I don't know if I like that.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.487
That's a little creepy.

00:00:51.487 --> 00:00:53.020
- We see people coming out,

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:54.123
like a rollercoaster.
- [Woman] Yeah.

00:00:54.123 --> 00:00:55.736
- Sometimes you see them all messed up,

00:00:55.736 --> 00:00:58.139
and you're like, "Uh oh."

00:00:58.139 --> 00:01:01.314
- I don't really know
what to expect with this.

00:01:01.314 --> 00:01:02.394
- I'm scared, I'm gonna lie.

00:01:02.394 --> 00:01:03.067
I'm a little scared.

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:05.963
I don't know what they're gonna do to me.

00:01:05.963 --> 00:01:07.945
Hopefully I'm here tomorrow.

00:01:07.945 --> 00:01:11.701
(low, haunting music)

00:01:27.494 --> 00:01:30.995
(dramatic music)

00:01:47.183 --> 00:01:49.624
- What the hell just happened?

00:01:51.534 --> 00:01:54.552
- That was really cool,
but it was really weird.

00:01:54.552 --> 00:01:56.396
I donno, it was...

00:01:56.396 --> 00:01:58.452
- Uh, I just walked out of there.

00:01:58.452 --> 00:02:01.319
It was a little bit more, like, erotic

00:02:01.319 --> 00:02:03.339
than I was expecting.

00:02:03.339 --> 00:02:05.104
- Every room, I was confused

00:02:05.104 --> 00:02:07.184
and just disoriented.

00:02:07.184 --> 00:02:10.579
It played on your, I guess, basic fears.

00:02:10.579 --> 00:02:13.040
- I never really knew what was going on,

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:15.780
but it was really fun.

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.765
- No one really jumped out at you,

00:02:17.765 --> 00:02:19.982
they more just like, grabbed on to you

00:02:19.982 --> 00:02:22.281
and guided you through this crazy

00:02:22.281 --> 00:02:24.080
mental experience.

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.717
- It was really rad.

00:02:25.717 --> 00:02:27.446
I would definitely do it again.

00:02:27.446 --> 00:02:28.944
- It was like I was tripping.

00:02:28.944 --> 00:02:31.080
Like stoned or something.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.543
- I know, I'm like,
"Can I drive home now?"

00:02:32.543 --> 00:02:33.623
Am I okay?

00:02:33.623 --> 00:02:35.016
Am I under the influence?

